# inc-q04n: a Mage casts a memorized arcane spell with no spellbook in the
# pack. Read by tools/check_mage_cast_nobook.sh.
#
#   INCURSION_OPTIONS=tools/fixtures/options-2026-08-22.dat \
#   INCURSION_LOAD=tools/fixtures/chars/orc-mage-seed1-opt0822.sav \
#       tools/headless.sh tools/keys/mage-cast-nobook.keys 1
#
# THE CHARACTER. Varag, the frozen Orc Mage (see mage-loadout-rest.keys). Burning
# Hands is one of his memorized level-1 picks. He carries six spellbooks.
#
# WHY BURNING HANDS. It is memorized in the fixture, it is Q_DIR, and aimed RIGHT
# into open floor with every monster genocided it hits nothing and only spends
# mana (see tools/keys/mana-regen-cast.keys). No target is needed.
#
# THE ROUTE (each @dump label is one assertion screen in the check):
#   1. Wizard mode, depth 2, genocide everything (as mage-loadout-rest.keys).
#   2. Drop all six books (inventory item 16, six times).     books-gone
#   3. 'm' opens the cast menu.                               cast-menu
#      Burning Hands, RIGHT. Screen after the cast.           after-cast
#      'v' reads the message log.                             msgs

s                       # one real turn: this counts as a session
w y                     # wizard mode, confirm
@choose "Ascend / Descend Depth"
"2" ENTER
@until "HP:" ESC
w
@choose "Genocide Everything"
@until "HP:" ESC

@dump:before-drop
i
1 6 d
1 6 d
1 6 d
1 6 d
1 6 d
1 6 d
@dump:books-gone
ESC
@until "Things in View" ESC

m
@dump:cast-menu
@choose "Shield"
@dump:after-cast
v
@dump:msgs
ESC
@dump:end
